# Dependency and build output, at any depth. `platform/.gitignore` covered
# `platform/node_modules/` only, so a vitest cache file written to the REPO
# ROOT's node_modules was tracked; 365 bytes of machine-specific state that
# changes on every run and belongs to nobody.
